- Figma File ID: cuPAW7JfIhcpdoI3C0yJdt
- Figma file extracted: Chat AI.fig (in project root)

## Design Tokens (from extracted .fig file)
- Background Color: #1E1E1E (RGB: 30, 30, 30) - Dark gray
- Canvas Size: 6080x2360 px

## Current Implementation
- See: composeApp/src/webMain/kotlin/ru/pravochat/clients/Colors.kt
- Background: #F9F9FA (needs update to match design #1E1E1E)

## MCP Figma Setup
- See: MCP_FIGMA_SETUP.md for configuration instructions
- Requires: Figma Personal Access Token

## Code Comments
- Comments should only be used in very rare cases when absolutely necessary for code understanding
- Prefer self-documenting code with clear variable and function names
- Remove unnecessary comments that just repeat what the code does

## Sitemap Maintenance
- The sitemap.xml file (composeApp/src/webMain/resources/sitemap.xml) must be kept up to date
- When adding, removing, or modifying HTML pages, update the sitemap.xml accordingly
- Include all public pages with correct URLs, lastmod dates, changefreq, and priority values
- Current pages: index.html (main), cases.html, about.html, practice.html, consult.html, premium.html
